          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orubara rwona rw'ab'oruganda rwa Efuraimu abasisiire, okwo emitwe yabo eli, nibagoba abantu 108,100. Baraimukyaga bali ba kashatu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.24",
